# GHSA-c8m5-c952-6cm4 remains present in rustls 0.23.36 bundled by the latest
# @temporalio/core-bridge 1.25.0; the package is NOT patched (fixed in rustls 0.23.46).
# https://github.com/rustls/rustls/security/advisories/GHSA-c8m5-c952-6cm4
# Exploitation requires a custom ClientSessionStore that logs TLS session values
# with Debug. The reviewed SDK core sources implement no such store; ordinary
# connection and built-in cache diagnostics remain redacted per the advisory.
# All three application workers connect without TLS on the private compose
# network (temporal:7233); native telemetry uses loopback Prometheus, not TLS OTLP.
# Remove/reassess immediately if these paths change, or when upstream ships
# rustls >=0.23.46. Recheck upstream by 2026-11-06; do not extend automatically.
GHSA-c8m5-c952-6cm4 exp:2026-11-06

